<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Pitch Challenge', path: '/challenge', description: 'The Innovate@Berkeley Pitch Challenge: grab your friends, create your own startup, craft a pitch deck and submit it.' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/site-header', { current: 'challenge' }) %>

    <main id="main">
        <section class="page-intro">
            <div class="wrap grid">
                <div class="page-intro__text">
                    <p class="kicker">Challenge yourself</p>
                    <h1>Compete at Innovate</h1>
                    <p class="page-intro__lede">Register now for the competition.</p>
                    <div class="hero__actions">
                        <a class="button button--primary button--large" href="#register">Register now</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <figure class="page-intro__photo">
                    <img src="/images/photos/innovate-143-960.jpg"
                         srcset="/images/photos/innovate-143-480.jpg 480w, /images/photos/innovate-143-960.jpg 960w"
                         sizes="(min-width: 900px) 58vw, 100vw"
                         width="960" height="640" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
                         alt="A speaker presenting a slide titled Chatbot Unicorns">
                </figure>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
            <div class="wrap grid">
                <header class="section__head">
                    <p class="kicker">The competition</p>
                    <h2 id="challenge-title">Innovate@<wbr>Berkeley Pitch Challenge</h2>
                </header>
                <div class="challenge-body">
                    <p>Grab your friends and create your own startup for a chance to win up to $500! Put your heads together, craft a pitch deck, and submit it. It's that easy. Once all of the applications are submitted, our team of judges will select the top 6 teams and those teams will have the opportunity to present live at the conference. After all 6 presentations, the judges will pick the top 3 teams to win a cash prize of $1000, $500, and $250.</p>
                    <h3 class="label">Timeline</h3>
                    <dl class="timeline">
                        <div><dt>November 9, 2026</dt><dd>Application Due</dd></div>
                        <div><dt>November 10, 2026</dt><dd>Top 6 Announced</dd></div>
                        <div><dt>November 12, 2026</dt><dd>Live Presentations</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" aria-labelledby="rules-title">
            <div class="wrap grid">
                <header class="section__head">
                    <p class="kicker">Before you apply</p>
                    <h2 id="rules-title">Challenge Rules</h2>
                </header>
                <div class="section__content">
                    <div class="rules">
                        <article>
                            <h3>Eligibility</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>The challenge is open to all college students. Participants must register with their school email address</li>
                                <li>Only startups that have raised less than $1 million are eligible</li>
                            </ul>
                        </article>
                        <article>
                            <h3>Team Requirements</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Teams can consist of 1 - 5 people</li>
                                <li>Every person can only be a part of one team</li>
                                <li>Teams that compete must be willing to travel to UC Berkeley on Nov 12 if they proceed to finals</li>
                            </ul>
                        </article>
                        <article>
                            <h3>Presentation &amp; Prizes</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>The pitch deck should be between 10-14 slides</li>
                                <li>All people enrolled in the challenge are automatically enrolled for the conference</li>
                                <li>Equal shares of the prize money will be paid immediately to all members of the team</li>
                            </ul>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                    <p class="section__more">Questions about the challenge: <a href="mailto:innovate@aez.berkeley.edu">innovate@aez.berkeley.edu</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
</body>
</html>
